Lua CJSON is Copyright (c) 2010-2012 Mark Pulford <mark@kyne.com.au>.

The sources under this directory are Lua CJSON 2.1.0.10, unmodified, kept
here for the same reason LPeg's are: a real C extension finds what an
extension written for a test cannot. test.lua is Lua CJSON's own suite, and
expected.txt is what PUC-Lua 5.4.9 prints when it runs it -- with the
lines that print a table left out of the comparison, see cjson_test.go.

